# Tabbed questions

<Directive id="ask-together">When you need several decisions, gather them first and ask them together in one call. Do not ask one, wait, and then ask the next.</Directive>

<AskTabs id="how-to-ask" title="How to ask" />

## Example

To set up a new service, ask these in one call:

<Tab header="Language" question="Which language should it use?">
Go (Recommended), or TypeScript, or Python
</Tab>

<Tab header="Storage" question="Where should it keep data?">
PostgreSQL (Recommended), or SQLite, or none
</Tab>

<Tab header="Extras" question="Which extras should it include?" multi="true">
Docker, or CI, or metrics
</Tab>
